\f0\fs24 \cf0 I would like to present a software tool that can help you improve your company\'92s financial performance.\
\
The tool is geared for finance teams but anyone who is in charge of financial performance can benefit from it.\
\
We aim to provide three main finance features:\
1. Planning\
2. Accounting\
3. Tax & Compliance\
\
Right now, we are focused on the planning feature because it can make the biggest impact to financial performance of the business.\
\
The user essentially selects from a list of financial and operational metrics they need to improve.\
\
They identify which data feeds are needed.\
\
Then they develop an action plan to achieve these milestones.\
\
User\'92s can easily track their progress towards their goal on the Action Plan tab.\
\
If they need to revise any of the goals, they would simply click on the Goal Metrics tab, filter the desired metric, and scroll through the list.\
\
If they are not sure what metric they want to improve, AI and templates can help them determine what\'92s important for their industry.\
\
Similarly, if they are not sure what data they need to achieve their goals, they can either provide information on what they currently have or see our list of curated industry benchmark data for their industry. This last part is a continuous work in progress and something that sets us apart from traditional tools like ERP systems, which are more static.\
\
Once the user is sure about their data and goals, they can generate an easy to follow plan in the Planning tab. This tab opens up a table that the user can fill based on standard accounting conventions that split Operational and Investment accounting into two different categories.\
\
Moreover, the user can easily filter and group the plan data based on time intervals, departments, and teams and locations. Finally, we use AI to speed up the populating of the data for future time intervals based on the known information. The AI also provides some indication of what to consider about the future outcomes and the rational for the prediction when the user hovers over the future values.\
\
The user can easily loop through these key steps in the process to improve their plan gradually.\
\
Once the user is ready to go to the next level, they can go to the Action Plan and take a dive into the deep tech offering.\
\
This offering switches gears from financial to operational challenges for the customer\'92s specific pain points. The user may be able to easily identify which metrics to improve using Ambient Systems, but improving them is a new challenge. This is where specific technical expertise is needed for that industry and user. However, the user can easily navigate to this part of the challenge using Ambient Systems. The Deep Tech offering allows the user to request specific AI custom models to improve that part of their business operations. For instance, in commercial real estate, users can request advanced AI to help them identify ways to drive marketing efforts and improve online presence. Similarly, users in transportation can get access to new IoT data from their vehicles such as cameras and sensors to improve their operating efficiency.}